# New independent trials: keep source, JSON evidence and optimized WebP
# showcases in normal Git. Historical v0.2.1-trial binaries committed in
# b0e8042 remain tracked (gitignore never removes tracked data).
# Generated raw/build binaries are distributed through release archives.
**/scenes/
**/exports/
**/raw_textures/
**/packed_textures/
**/renders/
**/showcase/*.png
**/evidence/*_sample.png
**/evidence/*_sample.webp
